Backport source-applicable nginx 1.31.9 fixes to nginx 1.30.6.

Retain RFC 7540 dependency/weight priorities in the HTTP/2 queue helper.
Omit the mainline version bump, maintainer dependency update, and fixes
for Control API, outbound PROXY v2 TLS TLVs and MMDB features absent
from 1.30.6. This backport does not assert a CVE-to-hunk mapping.

